{
  "author": "Portal Suite",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">Portal Suite</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">野村：BeOne业务与季度数据观察</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">8月5日相关市场收盘后，BeOne公布<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026年</span>第<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>业绩。当季收入同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">30%</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">17亿美元</span>，高于NOM与彭博一致预期约<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1亿美元</span>；净利润同比增<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">151%</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2.37亿美元</span>，显著超过卖方模型此前给出的5500万美元预测。利润超预期部分来自美国市场的税收抵扣优惠，当季实际税项支出7500万美元，低于NOM预期的1.29亿美元。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这份报告最值得关注的判断是：核心产品泽布替尼（zanubrutinib）的海外放量仍在<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">加速</span>，管理层因此将全年收入指引从63至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">65亿美元</span>上调至66至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">68亿美元</span>，非GAAP经营利润指引从14.5至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">15.5亿美元</span>上调至17至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">18亿美元</span>。NOM相应将<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">FY26</span>收入预测上调<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">5.3%</span>，盈利预测上调53.9%。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXCnfO02qlickfJ3DQicKXhiaFJuNUtwZ0eF1eOtcYibRviaDukcxwGserLpp9ppKootxMXqMOYKykvrhhad4j3k4PmibwGVTk66aM2I/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">研究主题与行业变化观察</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>泽布替尼全球销售<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">12.5亿美元</span>，同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">31%</span>、环比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">14%</span>。其中美国市场贡献<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">8.93亿美元</span>（同比增<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">31%</span>），欧洲与中国的增速分别为<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">30%</span>和17%。对比同类药物，ibrutinib当季销售同比下滑24%，acalabrutinib同比增长17%，新进入者pirtobrutinib基数较低但增速达56%。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">泽布替尼在海外市场的份额变化是这份报告的核心证据。NOM认为，该产品在BTK抑制剂市场的领先地位在<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>进一步巩固，这直接支撑了管理层上调全年指引的底气。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong><span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">编辑评论</span>：</strong> 泽布替尼的环比增速（<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">14%</span>）高于同比增速（<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">31%</span>）中隐含的季度平均增速，说明放量动能没有衰减。对比acalabrutinib的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">11%</span>环比增速，两者差距在扩大而非收窄。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWtKxCE1SxAwKTKDbbejybd1fOQgZ8TD7h3SsXtMkia4QrTOKWPlZ2Pw5ic09eiaeWzftx0t3Fs67ULP1BKysia1nVBHqhd4ICrLN0/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">研究主题与行业变化观察</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">管理层将全年收入指引上调约<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">5%</span>，但非GAAP经营利润指引上调幅度接近<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">15%</span>。<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">这意味着</span>利润率<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span>是本次指引调整的重要部分。NOM模型显示，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">FY26</span>毛利率预计从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">FY25</span>的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">87.5%</span>升至89.7%，经营利润率从11%升至19.1%。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">利润率的提升来自两个可核验的因素：收入规模带来的经营杠杆，以及美国税收抵扣对有效税率的压低。NOM预计<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">FY26</span>有效税率从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">FY25</span>的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">31.2%</span>降至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">23%</span>，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">FY27</span>进一步降至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">15%</span>。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOX8B1aiceVc40TVlX9EEMo58CfNez5oc7w3Z0ZB9dvjsA2zI2WC9YD6aI8gluVyaf98m0OZnjN4JFNFcUUpYaZxNoVicJan92f6U/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">3. 下半年临床数据将检验早期管线的兑现能力</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">报告披露，公司已启动CDK4抑制剂在HR+/HER2-乳腺癌的三期临床试验，并计划在下半年启动B7-H4 ADC用于一线卵巢癌维持治疗、GPC3×4-1BB双抗用于二线肝细胞癌的三期试验。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这些试验的启动时间点值得关注。泽布替尼的销售增长已经为市场提供了清晰的近期可见度，但中期估值能否维持，取决于这些早期资产能否产出阳性数据。NOM在观察提示中列出了三项：泽布替尼销售增速节奏变化、早期资产临床数据不达预期、地缘政治影响市场情绪。</p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">4. 估值框架与观察方法</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">，WACC取<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">10.6%</span>，永续增长率取<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">4%</span>。按<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">FY26</span>预测EPS 0.64美元计算，当前报价对应约<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">39倍</span>市盈率。公司处于净现金状态，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">FY26</span>预测净现金<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">37.75亿美元</span>，为后续研发投入提供了缓冲。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOV8qYkCjuoW1NpA1uvSqCP9Q0E4yIaIbYyOJHCtJeibm5VlH7ZxJibc6Vic9dRlo4cFXt4223CbbYpDq3pkBTwcvLnPBwDIjbFRxs/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"Portal Suite\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 95-NOM-BeOne-ONC.OQ-2Q26 results beat- FY26E guidance lifted...-260806</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见portal.example.invalid</p>",
